      "content": "wait, \"gobstones\"? i have no idea what that is, is that some kind of oceanography term i missed? \n\nand seriously, about those spikes... i'm telling you, they don't look like normal sensor noise. it's like the signal is being hijacked or something. do you think there's any chance it's some kind of external interference, like electromagnetic pulse or something weird from the trench itself? it feels way too coordinated to just be \"noise.\"",
